      "value": "<p>Fire washes over you. Whether hit to the front or in your back, the flames burn chest muscles and/ or shoulder muscles vital to your arm and shoulder function.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2). Both your arms also gain a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.qn4ZpvTQIX4rcJDl]{Torn Muscle (Major)}. You contract a Minor Infection due to heavy loss of skin.</p>"
